  "description": "It’s not easy to be a broke college student who also happens to a bit of a pushover. Scratch that; it’s damn hard. So when Henry receives an offer to make some easy cash, he caves in quickly. The offer? To impersonate his roommate, Felix, and go to addiction counseling in his stead. So Henry joins group counseling and meets Elliot. The most attractive, seductive man Henry has ever seen…who also happens to be a sex addict. Things are about to get a lot harder than Henry bargained for.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
